{
  "_doc": "Raw prompt text -> fast-mode switch (on = standalone #fast, off = #strict, which wins when both appear, none = no switch).  Tokens follow the #direct rules (direct_token_vectors.json): standalone, case-sensitive, code spans/fences masked.  Replayed by tests/test_shoal_guard.py (fast_switch plus the claude/codex/grok adapters) and hosts/opencode/plugin/tests/fast-switch.test.ts (fastSwitch); both must agree.",
  "vectors": [
    {
      "name": "plain #fast",
      "prompt": "#fast",
      "fast": "on"
    },
    {
      "name": "fast mid sentence",
      "prompt": "please go #fast now",
      "fast": "on"
    },
    {
      "name": "fast at end",
      "prompt": "ship it #fast",
      "fast": "on"
    },
    {
      "name": "plain #strict",
      "prompt": "#strict",
      "fast": "off"
    },
    {
      "name": "strict mid",
      "prompt": "back to #strict mode please",
      "fast": "off"
    },
    {
